    "body": "For future reference, if you met this error while doing startNotifications →  Uncaught (in promise) DOMException: GATT Error: Not supported.\r\nIt is probably because the characteristic you try to subscribe to doesn't have BLE2902 descriptor.\r\n\r\n#include <BLE2902.h>\r\nBLE2902* pid2902 = new BLE2902();\r\ncharact.addDescriptor(pid2902);\r\n",
